---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${siteConfig.name}`}
  description="Privacy policy including Google AdSense disclosures for Toolshack."
  showAds={false}
>
  <section class="hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="section content-card">
    <h2>1. Controller</h2>
    <p>
      Responsible for data processing on this website:
    </p>
    <p>
      Kurt Thomas Steinert<br />
      Fockestrasse 4<br />
      04275 Leipzig<br />
      Germany<br />
      Contact email: admin@kurthos.com
    </p>

    <h2>2. General Information</h2>
    <p>
      We process personal data only as required to provide a functioning website and our tools.
      Personal data means any information relating to an identified or identifiable natural person.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Hosting and Server Logs</h2>
    <p>
      When you access this website, technical information may be processed automatically by the
      hosting provider (for example IP address, date/time, requested URL, browser type, operating
      system, referrer). This processing is required for secure delivery of the website.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Tool Input Data</h2>
    <p>
      Our tools are designed to process your inputs directly in your browser whenever possible.
      We do not require user accounts for normal tool usage.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
    <p>
      This website may use cookies and similar technologies. Some are technically required, while
      others may be used for advertising or measurement. Where legally required, non-essential
      technologies are used only after user consent.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Google AdSense</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google AdSense, a service provided by Google Ireland Limited, Gordon House,
      Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland, and/or Google LLC, 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway,
      Mountain View, CA 94043, USA.
    </p>
    <p>
      AdSense may use cookies, web beacons, and similar technologies to display personalized or
      non-personalized advertising, limit ad frequency, and measure ad performance. In this process,
      data such as IP address, device information, browser information, and interactions with ads may
      be processed.
    </p>
    <p>
      Data may be processed on servers in countries outside your own jurisdiction. Where required,
      we rely on appropriate safeguards (such as Standard Contractual Clauses) and consent mechanisms.
    </p>
    <p>
      More information:
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a>
      and
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">How Google uses information from sites or apps</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Legal Bases</h2>
    <p>
      Where the GDPR applies, processing is based on one or more of the following legal bases:
      performance of a contract or pre-contractual measures, legal obligations, legitimate interests,
      and consent for optional technologies (especially advertising/personalization where required).
    </p>

    <h2>8. Storage Duration</h2>
    <p>
      We store personal data only as long as necessary for the respective purpose, legal obligations,
      or defense of legal claims.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on applicable law, you may have the right to access, rectification, erasure,
      restriction of processing, data portability, and objection to certain processing activities.
      You may also have the right to withdraw consent at any time with future effect.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Complaints</h2>
    <p>
      You may lodge a complaint with a supervisory data protection authority if you believe your
      personal data has been processed unlawfully.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this privacy policy to reflect legal, technical, or business changes.
      The latest version published on this page applies.
    </p>

    <p class="field-hint">Last updated: 2026-08-24</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
